---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import {
	LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LICENSE_PATH,
	SITE_BRAND,
	TERMS_PATH,
} from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Refund Policy"
	description="7-day money-back guarantee on every iStockVisual paid plan, including Lifetime Access."
	heading="Refund Policy"
	lede="Every paid plan includes a 7-day money-back guarantee. If you are not satisfied, you can request a full refund."
>
	<h2>1. 7-day money-back guarantee</h2>
	<p>
		All paid iStockVisual plans — Short-Term passes (1-Day, 7-Day, 1-Month) and Long-Term plans
		(6-Month, 12-Month, and Lifetime Access) — include a 7-day money-back guarantee from the time of
		purchase. If you are not satisfied, we will refund the amount you paid for that plan.
	</p>
	<p>
		This guarantee is in addition to any rights you have under consumer law. Those rights are not
		limited by this page.
	</p>

	<h2>2. How to request a refund</h2>
	<p>
		Email <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address on
		your account within 7 days of purchase. Include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>The email on the account</li>
		<li>The plan you bought (for example 7-Day Pass or Lifetime Access)</li>
		<li>The approximate purchase date</li>
		<li>A short note if something went wrong (optional, but it helps us improve)</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We aim to confirm eligible requests promptly and to return funds by the original payment method.</p>

	<h2>3. What happens after a refund</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Pro / pass access on that purchase ends when the refund is issued</li>
		<li>You can still use the site as a free member, including 500 and 1K downloads</li>
		<li>
			Files you already downloaded remain usable under the
			<a href={LICENSE_PATH}>Content License</a>, including the attribution requirement
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>4. After 7 days</h2>
	<p>
		Plans are one-time charges for a stated period (or Lifetime Access with no auto-renewal). After
		the 7-day window we do not offer refunds for change of mind, unused time, or a plan that has
		already expired, except where applicable law requires otherwise.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Chargebacks and abuse</h2>
	<p>
		If you believe a charge is wrong, contact us first so we can help. Filing a chargeback without
		contacting us may delay resolution. We may refuse or claw back a goodwill refund, and may
		suspend accounts, where we see repeated refund abuse, payment fraud, or automated download
		abuse. See also the <a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Refund questions for {SITE_BRAND}:
		<a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
